-- centre), modelled on the default male skull (fit0 = its half-width W at y 0.15, vertex T, front Fz at y 0.2,
-- back Bz at y 0.1). bbox = { cx, cy, cz, sx, sy, sz }; points = { x, y, z, ... } (HairFX's body tests).
